# Python environment — 610MB, machine-specific. Recreate with:
#   python3 -m venv .venv && .venv/bin/pip install -r requirements.txt
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Mock images (29MB) are fully regenerable from the fixed seed in config.json:
#   .venv/bin/python src/generate_mock_data.py
# REAL photos are different — they are irreplaceable measurement data. When
# they arrive, either drop this rule or track them with Git LFS. Do not let
# this line quietly discard a dataset that took weeks of culturing to produce.
images/*.png

# Test uploads from the web app, not experimental data.
captures/

# Scratch outputs
capture_test.png
/tmp/

# Secrets — none committed today, but the project will need Supabase keys
# (Phase 5) and those must never enter the repo.
.env
.env.*
*.key
secrets.json

# ภาพต้นฉบับกระเทียม (จัดคู่ UV/แสงปกติไว้ใน GA001..GA061) — ใหญ่และไม่ใช่โค้ด
# นำเข้าระบบด้วย src/ingest_folder.py --crop garlic แล้วเก็บจริงใน Supabase Storage
Garlic/
